config MTK_CLKBUF
	bool "MT6735 RF clock buffer control"
	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on PM
	depends on MFD_SYSCON
	help
	  Control of the four RF clock buffers (BB/MD, CONN, NFC, AUDIO) of
	  the MT6735/MT6737T.  The buffers are driven either through the SPM
	  MD BSI control register while the modem is powered, or through the
	  AP BSI command-word generator, exactly as the vendor SPM driver
	  does.

	  The driver implements clk_buf_ctrl()/clk_buf_get_swctrl_status()
	  for the CCCI RPC service (IPC_RPC_GET_RF_CLK_BUF_OP) and the WMT
	  CONSYS co-clock power sequence, and exports the sysfs knob
	  /sys/power/clk_buf/clk_buf_ctrl.

	  This option must be built in (=y), not modular: it registers a
	  group below power_kobj, which the kernel does not export to
	  modules.
